.Dd May 13, 2026
.Dt ANVIL.CONF 5
.Os

.Sh NAME
.Nm anvil.conf ,
.Nm stego.lock
.Nd configuration file for the anvil build system

.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
configuration file defines persistent build configuration,
test layout, and version metadata.

.Pp
The file uses TOML syntax and is typically stored as:

.Bd -literal -offset indent
stego.lock
.Ed

.Pp
The configuration is divided into four logical sections:

.Bl -tag -width "[versions]"

.It Sy [anvil]
Tool configuration.

.It Sy [build]
Build configuration.

.It Sy [tests]
Test directory layout.

.It Sy [versions]
Tag metadata registry.
.El

.Sh SECTIONS

.Ss [anvil]

Global tool configuration.

.Bl -tag -width "custombuilder"

.It Sy kern
Build backend selector.

Supported values include:

.Bl -tag -width "anvilPy"
.It Sy anvilC
Default C build pipeline.
.It Sy anvilPy
Python project backend.
.It Sy custom
User-defined build pipeline.
.El

.It Sy version
Compatibility version for toolchain behavior.

.It Sy custombuilder
Path to external builder script.
Only valid when
.Sy kern
is set to
.Sy custom .
.El

.Ss [build]

Defines build inputs and output artifacts.

.Bl -tag -width "automakevers"

.It Sy source
Primary source file or entry point.

.It Sy bin
Output executable name.

.It Sy makevers
Minimum tag version requiring make-based builds.

.It Sy automakevers
Minimum tag version requiring automake-based builds.

.It Sy tests
Optional test suite identifier or directory reference.
.El

.Ss [tests]

Defines test directory layout.

.Bl -tag -width "errortestsdir"

.It Sy testsdir
Directory containing standard tests.

.It Sy errortestsdir
Directory containing error or negative tests.
.El

.Ss [versions]

Mapping of build tags to human-readable descriptions.

.Pp
Each entry associates a tag identifier with a release description.

.Pp
Entries in this section are informational and do not affect execution.

.Sh BEHAVIOR

.Bl -tag -width "Evaluation timing"

.It Sy Precedence
Command-line options override configuration values.

.It Sy Defaults
Missing fields are replaced with implementation-defined defaults.

.It Sy Unknown fields
Unknown fields are ignored unless strict mode is enabled.

.It Sy Evaluation timing
Configuration is read before build execution begins.
.El

.Sh FILE RESOLUTION

The configuration file is resolved using the following order:

.Bl -enum
.It
Current working directory.

.It
Path specified via
.Fl -stego-dir .

.It
Implementation-defined project root.
.El

.Sh COMPATIBILITY

.Bl -tag -width "Extension behavior"

.It Sy Legacy formats
Compatible with earlier
.Nm
formats used in amboso.

.It Sy Extension behavior
invil extends parsing behavior while maintaining backward compatibility.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr anvil 1 ,
.Xr make 1 ,
.Xr git 1
